WEBVTT

00:00:01.590 --> 00:00:03.730
Satoshi and Go headed to Galar...

00:00:03.730 --> 00:00:06.650
...to investigate the mysteries of Daimax.

00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:09.240
In the forest,
they encountered mysterious Pokémon.

00:00:09.740 --> 00:00:13.490
As more and more secrets of the legend
were coming to light,

00:00:13.490 --> 00:00:20.330
Rose revived the ancient calamity Black Night,
under the name Mugendaina.

00:00:20.330 --> 00:00:25.460
Can Satoshi, Go and Dande
stop Mugendaina?!

00:02:03.020 --> 00:02:05.150
This is horrible!

00:02:05.150 --> 00:02:09.270
We’re getting more and more reports of
Daimax Pokémon running rampant!

00:02:09.270 --> 00:02:11.340
And look at this!

00:02:11.340 --> 00:02:15.780
Knuckle Stadium is under attack by
an unidentified gigantic Pokémon!

00:02:15.780 --> 00:02:19.830
Could the legendary calamity
have come back?!

00:02:26.250 --> 00:02:27.710
Mugendaina!

00:02:33.170 --> 00:02:34.620
He’s catching up!

00:02:34.620 --> 00:02:36.090
Stop it, Nyarth!

00:02:36.090 --> 00:02:37.850
This is not the time!

00:02:37.850 --> 00:02:40.540
Did you forget Sakaki’s orders?!

00:02:42.220 --> 00:02:45.480
Sa... ka... ki...?

00:02:45.480 --> 00:02:47.060
That’s right! Sakaki!

00:02:47.060 --> 00:02:50.030
You can get that monster
now, can’t you?!

00:02:53.520 --> 00:02:54.470
All right!

00:02:54.470 --> 00:02:55.910
Let’s follow him!

00:03:00.460 --> 00:03:02.180
Come back, Lizardon!

00:03:06.080 --> 00:03:08.250
We’ll battle with Kyodaimax!

00:03:12.860 --> 00:03:15.590
Sakaki...

00:03:19.540 --> 00:03:21.090
There! Go get it!

00:03:21.730 --> 00:03:25.380
Kyodai... Charm...!

00:03:36.370 --> 00:03:37.780
W-What?!

00:03:44.250 --> 00:03:46.950
<i>What an awful feeling!</i>

00:03:58.960 --> 00:04:00.090
What is this?!

00:04:04.330 --> 00:04:05.770
Behold!

00:04:06.150 --> 00:04:08.810
Mugendaina is absorbing Galar particles,

00:04:08.810 --> 00:04:11.770
in order to assume its final form!

00:04:13.510 --> 00:04:17.530
We will soon see the ultimate Pokémon,
bringing us infinite energy.

00:04:18.010 --> 00:04:20.360
Mr. Dande will seal it
before that happens!

00:04:20.720 --> 00:04:23.830
Riolu! Force Palm!
Pikachu! Iron Tail!

00:04:23.830 --> 00:04:26.060
Nutrey. Iron Defense!

00:04:30.840 --> 00:04:32.960
Daioudou,
use Heavy Bomber!

00:04:36.260 --> 00:04:37.920
Dodge it!

00:04:39.020 --> 00:04:40.050
Riolu! Force Palm!

00:04:43.890 --> 00:04:45.600
Heavy Bomber!

00:04:50.590 --> 00:04:53.110
One plays offense,
the other defense...

00:04:53.110 --> 00:04:54.020
In that case...!

00:04:54.020 --> 00:04:56.530
Pikachu! Lightning Speed!

00:04:56.530 --> 00:04:58.200
Riolu, use Shadow Clones!

00:04:58.760 --> 00:05:00.980
Run around!
Break their formation!

00:05:03.910 --> 00:05:05.490
I see...

00:05:07.500 --> 00:05:10.430
Now, Rabbifoot! Ember!

00:05:11.460 --> 00:05:13.500
Milokaross.
Water Pulse.

00:05:17.510 --> 00:05:18.980
Use a flurry of Embers!

00:05:23.260 --> 00:05:24.470
Water Pulse.

00:05:28.850 --> 00:05:30.850
Rabbifoot! Are you okay?!

00:05:32.460 --> 00:05:33.350
Useless.

00:05:33.350 --> 00:05:38.110
I’m amazed that you thought
you could stop Mugendaina, as weak as you are.

00:05:38.590 --> 00:05:41.610
Mugendaina...?
You mean Black Night?

00:05:41.610 --> 00:05:46.490
Indeed. Mugendaina is
Chairman Rose’s dream itself.

00:05:46.490 --> 00:05:48.910
I, too, must
bear witness to his dream.

00:05:49.780 --> 00:05:52.000
So kindly stop wasting my time
and fall!

00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:53.420
Dragon Claw!

00:05:59.340 --> 00:06:00.630
Lizardon!

00:06:09.060 --> 00:06:12.810
Nutrey, Daioudou.
Beat them down with Power Whip!

00:06:15.730 --> 00:06:19.170
Pikachu, to the right!
Riolu, retreat to dodge!

00:06:19.170 --> 00:06:19.900
Pikachu, to the left!

00:06:25.150 --> 00:06:27.530
Are you attempting to
stall for time?

00:06:30.250 --> 00:06:31.910
Dodge by leaping back!

00:06:33.750 --> 00:06:36.710
There is no escape.
Power Whip!

00:06:36.710 --> 00:06:38.210
Now! Jump!

00:06:42.330 --> 00:06:43.630
Was this your plan?!

00:06:44.120 --> 00:06:46.340
Good job, Pikachu, Riolu!

00:06:52.010 --> 00:06:53.610
I guess Ember won’t work.

00:06:54.260 --> 00:06:55.980
Rabbifoot, change of plans!

00:06:55.980 --> 00:06:57.980
Dodge the attacks
with Lightning Sp—

00:06:58.670 --> 00:07:00.400
Rabbifoot...

00:07:01.280 --> 00:07:05.740
Besides, I really wanted
to settle the match with Ember.

00:07:06.740 --> 00:07:10.930
Because that’s the move Rabbifoot
and I made together!

00:07:12.620 --> 00:07:14.860
I see... You...

00:07:14.860 --> 00:07:16.540
You wanna win with Ember, yeah?

00:07:18.040 --> 00:07:19.090
Water Pulse!

00:07:22.760 --> 00:07:23.660
Rabbifoot!

00:07:24.280 --> 00:07:28.300
It’s over. Milokaross,
finish them with Aqua Tail!

00:07:33.610 --> 00:07:35.060
Dodge it, Lizardon!

00:07:37.560 --> 00:07:40.030
Pikachu! 100,000 Volts!

00:07:44.670 --> 00:07:45.610
Pikachu!

00:07:47.280 --> 00:07:48.400
What?!

00:07:48.400 --> 00:07:49.240
It can’t be...!

00:07:55.270 --> 00:07:56.370
W-What?

00:07:59.900 --> 00:08:01.880
Mugendaina?!

00:08:08.360 --> 00:08:10.060
We have to stop it!

00:08:10.940 --> 00:08:13.080
Can you fight, Pikachu?

00:08:14.640 --> 00:08:17.520
I will not let you go.
Power Whip!

00:08:23.590 --> 00:08:24.440
Riolu!

00:08:31.200 --> 00:08:32.200
Crush it.

00:08:32.200 --> 00:08:34.120
Don’t push yourself
too hard, Riolu!

00:08:43.760 --> 00:08:45.250
You...

00:08:46.100 --> 00:08:51.430
Think! Think!
How can we win with Ember?

00:08:56.300 --> 00:08:57.550
I know!

00:08:58.100 --> 00:09:01.190
Rabbifoot, attack from an angle!

00:09:01.190 --> 00:09:02.860
Use the walls and ceiling!

00:09:03.990 --> 00:09:06.640
It’ll be fine! Let’s win together!

00:09:08.070 --> 00:09:11.170
Fire a flurry of Embers!
Now!

00:09:16.500 --> 00:09:19.410
Aqua Tail!
Knock them all down!

00:09:22.460 --> 00:09:24.750
Good! Keep pushing them back
with Ember!

00:10:01.620 --> 00:10:03.830
Riolu evolved into Lucario!

00:10:06.930 --> 00:10:10.840
Lucario. Aura Pokémon.
Fighting/Steel type.

00:10:10.840 --> 00:10:13.290
It controls waves known as auras,

00:10:13.290 --> 00:10:16.000
and it can sense what is in people’s hearts.

00:10:18.220 --> 00:10:20.270
All right! Use Vacuum Wave!

00:10:24.780 --> 00:10:26.970
Ah, I gotcha.

00:10:26.970 --> 00:10:28.520
Lucario! Aura Sphere!

00:10:32.650 --> 00:10:34.780
Another Aura Sphere!

00:10:39.700 --> 00:10:42.200
You did it, Lucario!

00:10:44.370 --> 00:10:46.070
Let’s go meet up with Mr. Dande!

00:10:50.840 --> 00:10:53.220
Are you all right,
Daioudou, Nutrey?!

00:11:04.110 --> 00:11:07.610
Rabbifoot... evolved!

00:11:07.610 --> 00:11:09.150
Awesome!

00:11:11.770 --> 00:11:15.720
Aceburn! Striker Pokémon!
Fire type!

00:11:15.720 --> 00:11:21.370
Its Pyro Ball attack strikes its opponents hard
with a burning soccer ball, leaving them scorched!

00:11:21.370 --> 00:11:24.040
Aceburn! Pyro Ball!

00:11:36.500 --> 00:11:39.350
O-Oh, no...

00:11:41.330 --> 00:11:43.560
You did it, Aceburn!

00:11:49.970 --> 00:11:52.230
Satoshi, we’ll be right there!

00:11:52.230 --> 00:11:54.740
Duraludon! Wide Breaker!

00:11:59.740 --> 00:12:01.210
Y-You’ll regret this!

00:12:03.350 --> 00:12:06.070
Um... Thank you.

00:12:06.070 --> 00:12:07.840
Don’t sweat it.

00:12:07.840 --> 00:12:09.350
Now, then...

00:12:09.350 --> 00:12:11.210
I would like to invite you
on a date or something,

00:12:11.650 --> 00:12:16.400
But it looks like those unruly, rampaging Pokémon
just won’t leave me alone.

00:12:16.400 --> 00:12:18.500
See ya later, babe.

00:12:18.500 --> 00:12:20.300
Let’s go, Duraludon!

00:12:22.530 --> 00:12:23.560
What about Black Night?

00:12:31.350 --> 00:12:33.650
Lizardon! Air Slash!

00:12:39.910 --> 00:12:43.220
That’s it!
Focus the attacks on its mouth!

00:12:43.220 --> 00:12:45.570
All right!
Lizardon’s pushing it back!

00:12:45.570 --> 00:12:46.540
Satoshi!

00:12:46.980 --> 00:12:48.530
Lucario?

00:12:48.530 --> 00:12:51.250
I see! So you beat Chairman Rose?

00:12:51.250 --> 00:12:52.260
Yeah!

00:12:52.260 --> 00:12:54.360
Hey, Satoshi!

00:12:54.360 --> 00:12:55.980
Go! And...

00:12:57.820 --> 00:13:01.090
This is Aceburn!
Rabbifoot evolved!

00:13:01.090 --> 00:13:03.550
Whoa! Awesome!

00:13:03.550 --> 00:13:06.060
Wait... Is that Riolu?!

00:13:07.100 --> 00:13:09.440
Riolu evolved, too!
Into Lucario!

00:13:09.440 --> 00:13:11.310
For real?!

00:13:11.310 --> 00:13:12.810
Way to go!

00:13:16.820 --> 00:13:18.560
So that’s Mugendaina?

00:13:18.560 --> 00:13:19.280
Yeah.

00:13:19.280 --> 00:13:22.160
It really is a legendary calamity!

00:13:22.160 --> 00:13:24.030
It’s given us some trouble,
but we finally cornered it!

00:13:24.450 --> 00:13:25.980
It’s Champion time!

00:13:25.980 --> 00:13:29.040
Now, Lizardon! Air Slash!

00:13:34.020 --> 00:13:36.550
Now I’ll catch it!

00:13:41.770 --> 00:13:42.470
You did it!

00:13:42.470 --> 00:13:43.340
Wait!

00:13:49.640 --> 00:13:50.770
Watch out!

00:14:03.920 --> 00:14:05.780
Come back, Lizardon!

00:14:15.400 --> 00:14:16.950
The sky!

00:14:16.950 --> 00:14:20.460
Is this Mugendaina?!

00:14:28.140 --> 00:14:31.790
Mugendaina’s gotten
way bigger than it was!

00:14:32.980 --> 00:14:36.520
Is that its final form?

00:14:37.770 --> 00:14:40.980
You two... Run...!

00:14:40.980 --> 00:14:42.610
Mr. Dande!

00:14:44.990 --> 00:14:48.240
Oh, how magnificent! Yes!

00:14:49.440 --> 00:14:51.210
What <i>is</i> that form?

00:14:51.210 --> 00:14:55.280
Show them your power,
Mugendaina!

00:14:56.920 --> 00:14:59.200
We’ll stop it!

00:14:59.200 --> 00:15:00.080
Yeah!

00:15:00.750 --> 00:15:02.390
Let’s go at full power!

00:15:02.390 --> 00:15:05.660
Lucario, use Aura Sphere!
Pikachu, use 100,000 Volts!

00:15:05.660 --> 00:15:07.380
Aceburn! Pyro Ball!

00:15:23.180 --> 00:15:24.750
It didn’t work?!

00:15:24.750 --> 00:15:25.710
Again!

00:15:41.170 --> 00:15:42.820
Pikachu! Lucario!

00:15:42.820 --> 00:15:44.130
Aceburn!

00:15:44.740 --> 00:15:48.180
Gah... It’s too powerful...

00:15:50.470 --> 00:15:51.070
Did these...

00:15:51.070 --> 00:15:52.670
...just glow?

00:15:53.460 --> 00:15:55.060
What are these?

00:15:55.060 --> 00:15:57.690
I found them in
the Slumbering Weald.

00:15:57.690 --> 00:15:59.440
Could they be...

00:15:59.440 --> 00:16:01.820
...the legendary sword and shield?

00:16:09.610 --> 00:16:10.860
Dande!

00:16:12.770 --> 00:16:13.580
Sonia?

00:16:15.530 --> 00:16:16.520
Here it comes!

00:16:18.590 --> 00:16:20.090
Go! Satoshi!

00:16:22.190 --> 00:16:23.500
They glowed again?

00:16:25.010 --> 00:16:29.700
Well, then... I guess we just gotta
<i>become</i> the legend, yeah?!

00:16:29.700 --> 00:16:31.180
You got that right!

00:16:31.690 --> 00:16:33.430
Come on, Mugendaina!

00:16:33.430 --> 00:16:35.620
I will... battle it...!

00:16:35.620 --> 00:16:37.770
No! Don’t push yourself!

00:16:37.770 --> 00:16:40.020
We will protect...

00:16:40.020 --> 00:16:42.160
...Galar’s people and Pokémon!

00:17:05.780 --> 00:17:06.880
Is that...?

00:17:12.240 --> 00:17:13.410
Zamazenta!

00:17:13.410 --> 00:17:14.390
Zacian!

00:17:29.220 --> 00:17:30.550
They transformed!

00:17:30.550 --> 00:17:32.660
You’ll fight with us?

00:17:32.660 --> 00:17:36.370
The sword and shield
the legendary heroes wielded...

00:17:36.370 --> 00:17:40.160
They were actually
Pokémon themselves?!

00:17:43.170 --> 00:17:45.960
You guys... Let’s do this!

00:17:45.960 --> 00:17:47.670
We <i>will</i> defeat Mugendaina!

00:17:59.780 --> 00:18:01.060
Yes! It’s working!

00:18:01.060 --> 00:18:03.360
Hang in there, Mugendaina!

00:18:03.360 --> 00:18:06.350
You are Galar’s future!

00:18:15.780 --> 00:18:17.700
Aceburn! Pyro Ball!

00:18:20.410 --> 00:18:24.080
Lucario, use Aura Sphere!
Pikachu, use 100,000 Volts!

00:18:52.560 --> 00:18:53.940
We did it!

00:18:53.940 --> 00:18:55.000
Maybe...

00:18:55.000 --> 00:18:56.700
...we can catch it now?

00:18:56.700 --> 00:18:58.520
Whoa!

00:18:58.520 --> 00:18:59.730
Go!

00:18:59.730 --> 00:19:00.830
Let’s do it!

00:19:00.830 --> 00:19:02.080
Ready, and...

00:19:02.080 --> 00:19:04.830
Monster Ball, go!

00:19:20.060 --> 00:19:23.980
Mugendaina’s data will be
added to the Index!

00:19:28.490 --> 00:19:30.990
All right!

00:19:39.090 --> 00:19:40.820
Zacian! Zamazenta!

00:19:58.380 --> 00:19:59.950
The black clouds are gone.

00:19:59.950 --> 00:20:02.940
Yeah. Just like in the legend.

00:20:08.980 --> 00:20:10.850
Thank you, everyone.

00:20:11.410 --> 00:20:12.480
Mr. Dande.

00:20:13.020 --> 00:20:15.870
You have saved Galar.

00:20:15.870 --> 00:20:18.510
You two really were incredible!

00:20:18.510 --> 00:20:21.100
You are the legendary heroes!

00:20:22.880 --> 00:20:25.980
No, it wasn’t us.

00:20:25.980 --> 00:20:27.750
It was Zacian and Zamazenta!

00:20:35.820 --> 00:20:37.760
That must have been quite tough.

00:20:40.410 --> 00:20:42.760
And Chairman Rose’s whereabouts
are still unknown?

00:20:42.760 --> 00:20:46.770
Yes. Though Dande is
helping search for him.

00:20:47.470 --> 00:20:53.110
Although Mugendaina remains asleep,
contained deep beneath the earth,

00:20:53.650 --> 00:20:57.040
the possibility remains
that it may reawaken.

00:20:57.040 --> 00:21:00.800
We need to look into countermeasures,
should that ever happen.

00:21:01.810 --> 00:21:03.160
I will be counting on you for that...

00:21:03.160 --> 00:21:04.870
Professor Sonia.

00:21:04.870 --> 00:21:06.040
Of course!

00:21:06.600 --> 00:21:12.170
I’ll do my best to live up
to this professor’s coat you gave me!

00:21:16.170 --> 00:21:18.670
Thank you, Zacian.

00:21:19.100 --> 00:21:21.050
Let’s battle someday!

00:21:22.080 --> 00:21:25.790
Zamazenta,
I’ll catch you someday!

00:21:27.430 --> 00:21:29.770
With this grand case revolving around
Galar’s legends behind them,

00:21:29.770 --> 00:21:32.700
Satoshi and Go
have both grown once more.

00:21:33.280 --> 00:21:37.350
The door to another adventure
surely awaits them!

00:21:50.910 --> 00:21:51.710
Mew!

00:21:51.710 --> 00:21:52.460
Warrgle!

00:21:52.460 --> 00:21:53.210
Runpappa!

00:21:53.210 --> 00:21:54.000
Pawou!

00:21:54.000 --> 00:21:54.750
Ulgamoth!

00:21:54.750 --> 00:21:55.540
Strike!

00:21:55.540 --> 00:21:56.340
Cresselia!

00:21:56.340 --> 00:21:57.050
Amakaji!

00:21:57.050 --> 00:21:57.840
Jirachi!

00:21:57.840 --> 00:21:58.630
Chobomaki!

00:21:58.630 --> 00:21:59.420
Kibago!

00:21:59.420 --> 00:22:00.170
Gonbe!

00:22:00.170 --> 00:22:00.970
Bayleaf!

00:22:00.970 --> 00:22:02.470
Freezer!

00:22:02.470 --> 00:22:03.680
Zacian!

00:22:19.730 --> 00:22:20.530
Mew!

00:22:20.530 --> 00:22:21.320
Wooper!

00:22:21.320 --> 00:22:22.070
Pachirisu!

00:22:22.070 --> 00:22:22.900
Sunaba!

00:22:22.900 --> 00:22:23.570
Absol!

00:22:23.570 --> 00:22:24.450
Lunala!

00:22:24.450 --> 00:22:25.240
Rabbifoot!

00:22:25.240 --> 00:22:26.030
Tropius!

00:22:26.030 --> 00:22:26.780
Sunahebi!

00:22:26.780 --> 00:22:27.660
Vibrava!

00:22:27.660 --> 00:22:28.330
Burshamo!

00:22:28.330 --> 00:22:29.080
Mokuroh!

00:22:29.080 --> 00:22:29.910
Rotom!

00:22:29.910 --> 00:22:30.620
Mooland!

00:22:30.620 --> 00:22:31.410
Dodorio!

00:22:31.410 --> 00:22:32.120
Otosupus!

00:22:32.120 --> 00:22:32.960
Swanna!

00:22:32.960 --> 00:22:33.710
Nazonokusa!

00:22:33.710 --> 00:22:34.500
Samehada!

00:22:34.500 --> 00:22:35.290
Darkrai!

00:22:35.290 --> 00:22:35.960
Iwanko!

00:22:35.960 --> 00:22:36.790
Cortoise!

00:22:36.790 --> 00:22:37.630
Scorupi!

00:22:37.630 --> 00:22:38.380
Pippi!

00:22:38.380 --> 00:22:39.130
Pinpuku!

00:22:39.130 --> 00:22:39.880
Kunugidama!

00:22:39.880 --> 00:22:40.630
Mankey!

00:22:40.630 --> 00:22:41.460
Kimori!

00:22:41.460 --> 00:22:42.260
Ligray!

00:22:42.260 --> 00:22:43.720
Rayquaza!

00:22:43.720 --> 00:22:44.430
Zamazenta!

00:23:07.090 --> 00:23:09.510
Now! Onto the next adventure!

00:23:09.510 --> 00:23:10.830
Go!

00:23:11.080 --> 00:23:15.980
You see, we’ve detected psychic energy
believed to belong to Mew.

00:23:15.980 --> 00:23:18.400
What?!

00:23:18.860 --> 00:23:21.700
The isolated island of Cello, huh?

00:23:21.700 --> 00:23:23.550
Why have you come here?

00:23:23.550 --> 00:23:25.240
A talking Pokémon?!

00:23:25.240 --> 00:23:26.930
Mewtwo...

00:23:27.360 --> 00:23:28.640
Show me what you can do.

00:23:28.640 --> 00:23:30.340
Next time, on Pocket Monsters:

00:23:30.340 --> 00:23:33.950
Battling and Catching!
Mewtwo Rises Again
